# P5 framework depth (java): Jackson/SnakeYAML deserialization, Hibernate HQL.

test "java: request param -> Jackson readValue is unsafe deserialization"
  lang java
  expect VYQL-DESER-001
  code
  ```
  @RestController
  public class C {
    @GetMapping("/x")
    public Object x(@RequestParam String body) throws Exception {
      ObjectMapper m = new ObjectMapper();
      return m.readValue(body, Object.class);
    }
  }
  ```

test "java: request param -> Hibernate createQuery is HQL injection"
  lang java
  expect VYQL-INJ-001
  code
  ```
  @RestController
  public class C {
    @GetMapping("/u")
    public Object u(@RequestParam String name) {
      return session.createQuery("FROM User WHERE name = '" + name + "'").list();
    }
  }
  ```

test "java: a constant HQL query is clean"
  lang java
  reject VYQL-INJ-001
  code
  ```
  @RestController
  public class C {
    @GetMapping("/u")
    public Object u() {
      return session.createQuery("FROM User").list();
    }
  }
  ```
